--approximately 4.5 scores, compated with approximately 2.4 for shipments with an exception recorded.--
--There is a strong association between exceptions and lower customer satisfaction.--
--Shipment statuses appear to have a strong relationship with customer satisfaction scores. Refused loads average--
--approximately 1.1, compared with approximately 3.9 for delivered shipments.--
